OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fa few showers at first in the evening.
OL,7,FMore widespread low cloud and
OL,8,Fpersistent rain moving in after
OL,9,Fmidnight. While mostly light, there is
OL,10,Fa chance for spells of heavier rain at
OL,11,Ftimes.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA wet start, with overnight
OL,14,Frain continuing, before gradually
OL,15,Fclearing east through the day. Turning
OL,16,Fbrighter but also fresher from the
OL,17,Fwest, with all parts dry by the late
OL,18,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
